				<r3d:description language="eng">Real-Time Database for high-resolution Neutron Monitor measurements.
NMDB provides access to Neutron Monitor measurements from stations around the world. The goal of NMDB is to provide easy access to all Neutron Monitor measurements through an easy to use interface. NMDB provides access to real-time as well as historical data.</r3d:description>
